##OpenGL GLIB
Perspective 70
LookAt  0 0 12  0 0 0  0 1 0

Texture2D 8 snake.bmp
Vertex   snake.vert
Fragment snake.frag
Program  SnakeH                       \
    uColorUnit 8                      \
    speed <0.0 0.0 20.0>              \
    opacity <0.0 1.0 1.0>             \
    amplitude <0.0 0.0 20.0>

Color 1.0 1.0 1.0
Obj snakeH.obj 1.0 1 1

// I am going to split the grass and snake shaders
Texture2D 6 grass.bmp
Vertex grass.vert
Fragment grass.frag
Program Grass uColorUnit 6

QuadXZ -0.1 100.0 128 128
